---
const nodes = [
  {name:'Read the question',tech:'Discord',text:'The forum title, post and replies stay in one conversation.',file:'src/bot/handlers/router.ts'},
  {name:'Find saved facts',tech:'MongoDB',text:'Exact match, then text and local embeddings. Scoped to this server.',file:'src/memory/retriever.ts'},
  {name:'Write a short reply',tech:'Paper / Ollama',text:'The model gets the question, context and approved evidence.',file:'src/agent/orchestrator.ts'},
  {name:'Check the source',tech:'Response policy',text:'Check citations and links before posting. Unsupported answers wait.',file:'src/agent/policy.ts'},
];
---
<section class="support-inside wrap" id="inside" aria-labelledby="inside-title">
  <div class="inside-opening"><h2 id="inside-title">Under the hood.</h2><p>One bounded pass, from question to reply.</p></div>
  <ol class="code-path">{nodes.map(node=><li><a href={`https://github.com/sea-deep/threadsherpa/blob/main/${node.file}`} target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer"><span class="path-tech">{node.tech}<img src="/icons/arrow-right-up-linear.svg" width="18" height="18" alt=""/></span><h3>{node.name}</h3><p>{node.text}</p></a></li>)}</ol>
  <div class="quiet-branch"><svg viewBox="0 0 36 36" width="30" height="30" fill="none" aria-hidden="true"><path d="M8 3v15c0 5 4 9 9 9h12m-6-6 6 6-6 6" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round"/></svg><p>No matching facts?<br /><strong>Skip generation. Leave it for a person.</strong></p></div>
  <details class="memory-detail"><summary>What gets stored?<span aria-hidden="true">+</span></summary><p>The approved answer, its original question, source and scope. Duplicate saves reuse the same knowledge. A moderator chooses any optional web sources. <a href="https://github.com/sea-deep/threadsherpa/blob/main/src/memory/learner.ts" target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer">Read the memory code.</a></p></details>
</section>
